<title>USA: Huntington Beach PFA., Calif. won by Merrill. [CORRECTED 19:12 GMT]</title>
<headline>Huntington Beach PFA., Calif. won by Merrill. [CORRECTED 19:12 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. (corrects from Chilton O'Connor) said it won $8 million of Huntington Beach Pub Finan Auth., Calif., lease revenue bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.47 percent (corrects from 5.45 percent).</p>
